# Every path below needs the maintainer's review: branch protection requires
# code-owner review. A pull_request run uses the pull request's own workflow
# file, so this review, not CI, is what protects the workflows and the tools.
# Result pull requests (results/<lab>/ only) are merged by the maintainer too,
# and only when every changed path is inside results/<lab>/.

/.github/            @craigm26
/tools/              @craigm26
/kits.lock           @craigm26
/POLICY.md           @craigm26
/CODEOWNERS          @craigm26
/labs/               @craigm26

# Files that say what a result means and how the data is licensed.
/README.md           @craigm26
/results/README.md   @craigm26
/LICENSE             @craigm26
/LICENSES/           @craigm26
/REUSE.toml          @craigm26
/.gitattributes      @craigm26
/.gitignore          @craigm26
